# shell: desktop
# Q-023/Q-045/CW-033: a search leaves a record, and the window it produced
# offers Edit query, which reopens the panel ON that query rather than
# running the same search again.
note a search from the Find panel
key f ctrl
wait 5
key z
key q
key x
key j
key v
wait 3
click 595 452
wait 25
expect-find-text zqxjv
expect-windows 2
note Search is the primary action and closes the Find panel after it runs
note the results window answers Cmd+G, which every menu advertises
key g ctrl
wait 8
expect-title Find
note and it came back holding what was searched for, not empty
expect-find-text zqxjv
quit
